 select molecular objects and learn more about them. \nEnjoy!", "short_description": "Learn and experience chemistry on an atomic level. There are two modules: Stereochemistry and Molecular Geometries. \nTo enter one of the modules press and hold the Gear VR touchpad. Audio instructions are given, so head-phones are recommended for an optimal experience. In the scene, press and hold the touchpad to travel in the direction you are facing. Release the touchpad to stop/freeze the view. Double-click on the touchpad to select molecular objects and learn more about them. \nEnjoy!"}]}, "developer_name": "Magnus Norrby", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://educhem-vr.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://educhem-vr.com/", "publisher_name": "EduChem VR Sweden AB", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://educhem-vr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "620453415700521"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162716_1740457356263833_5307649687371644928_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MRBnCaHCEfoQ7kNvwGOGoDm&_nc_oc=AdmS8UnhB357qRENNHCKBViPlALCv86VEh65ALZ1PgHyMDYvX4zmyRK6cri9wbjUcB4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg1-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft7KfA7HV4FzYMFL9lTLlttwJ92Rb2ty4GjPLuMHgzFcQ&oe=69A18743"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Chemistry VR", "platform": "ANDROID", "conte